# How Big Is Too Big?

**Authors:** Cibes, Margaret, Greenwood, James

## Abstract
Media Clips appears in every issue of Mathematics Teacher, offering readers contemporary, authentic applications of quantitative reasoning based on print or electronic media. This issue features &quot;How Big is Too Big?&quot; (Margaret Cibes and James Greenwood) in which students are asked to analyze the data and tables provided and answer a series of questions. Also provided is &quot;Attendance Matters&quot; based on &quot;Cracking Down on Skipping Class,&quot; &quot;Wall Street Journal,&quot; Jan. 14, 2015 (Douglas Belkin). Questions and solutions are provided.

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ1113077

